WEBVTT

00:02.649 --> 00:06.778
<i>The new lord of the Kasdeks territory?</i>

00:08.196 --> 00:12.242
I heard he also keeps a bunch
of female slaves by his side.

00:14.160 --> 00:17.622
<i>We can't let anyone like him
anywhere near Ilk Village.</i>

00:18.623 --> 00:22.377
That guy with the barrel-like belly
has a very strong blue color.

00:22.835 --> 00:23.669
What?

00:23.670 --> 00:27.340
Although not as much as you,
it's still a pretty strong blue.

00:27.549 --> 00:29.676
And there's no one around
in red either.

00:34.556 --> 00:37.558
I am truly sorry!

00:37.559 --> 00:42.230
I just wanted to meet Lord Dias,
whom I admire most deeply.

00:42.981 --> 00:45.441
My name is Eldan Kasdeks.

00:45.692 --> 00:47.860
Just call me Eldan.

00:49.862 --> 00:55.827
<i>Let out an exhausted sigh,
the corner of my heart dyed in blue</i>

00:56.035 --> 00:58.245
<i>Brightening up this place</i>

00:58.246 --> 01:00.957
<i>Looking up at a proud self</i>

01:01.416 --> 01:03.917
<i>Amidst a world constantly turning upside down</i>

01:03.918 --> 01:06.587
<i>On the only path where I seemed to be lost</i>

01:06.588 --> 01:09.757
<i>I still stand firm on my own two feet</i>

01:11.926 --> 01:16.430
<i>Lamenting my lonely fate,
looking up at the distant sky</i>

01:16.431 --> 01:20.602
<i>Without a single reply
but we are still connected</i>

01:22.854 --> 01:24.981
<i>When will it end?</i>

01:25.523 --> 01:28.610
<i>The incompetent will eventually fall</i>

01:29.569 --> 01:33.573
<i>I wonder when this red color
will be completely eradicated</i>

01:34.907 --> 01:37.909
<i>Brushing everything aside,
soaring into the sky</i>

01:37.910 --> 01:42.456
<i>My heart is bright blue</i>

01:42.457 --> 01:43.582
<i>I can't fall anymore</i>

01:43.583 --> 01:49.254
<i>Let out an exhausted sigh,
the corner of my heart dyed in blue</i>

01:49.255 --> 01:54.426
<i>Raising my fist high,
determined to go to the very end</i>

01:54.427 --> 01:56.887
<i>Even if I'm knocked down by life a hundred times</i>

01:56.888 --> 01:59.598
<i>This blue color will still protect me</i>

01:59.599 --> 02:04.896
<i>Looking up at a proud self</i>

02:10.193 --> 02:12.903
<i>The endless song will echoes forever</i>

02:12.904 --> 02:15.782
<i>I am a proud blue color</i>

02:19.952 --> 02:25.541
Since I was a child, I have long idolized
the national hero, Dias.

02:25.833 --> 02:29.170
So I wanted to be friends with you.

02:29.712 --> 02:33.466
I would never do anything bad,
so please don't be angry.

02:35.385 --> 02:38.971
I'm not angry or anything... Lord Eldan.

02:39.305 --> 02:44.769
On the contrary, I should apologize for
being rude towards Camarotz earlier.

02:45.478 --> 02:48.021
Don't worry about being rude.

02:48.022 --> 02:50.566
Just call us by our names.

02:51.109 --> 02:52.735
By the way, Lord Dias.

02:53.277 --> 02:55.279
Who is the girl next to you?

02:57.281 --> 03:01.327
She's really good at hiding.

03:01.911 --> 03:05.331
But I have very sharp ears and nose,
so I still noticed her.

03:05.915 --> 03:10.253
She has a gentle scent,
just like you.

03:11.129 --> 03:13.965
<i>My concealment magic didn't work!?</i>

03:23.433 --> 03:25.934
What race does she belong to?

03:25.935 --> 03:28.771
What is the relationship between you two?

03:29.021 --> 03:31.648
Her name is Alna. She's my fiancée...

03:31.649 --> 03:33.025
WIFE
Your wife!

03:34.694 --> 03:36.154
I'm your wife.

03:38.364 --> 03:39.240
Yeah.

03:39.741 --> 03:41.159
That horn...

03:41.576 --> 03:43.536
Is Alna a demi-human?

03:43.870 --> 03:47.206
I'm from the demon tribe,
this horn has been there since birth.

03:47.665 --> 03:51.085
I've never heard the term "demi-human",
so I can't answer that.

03:51.461 --> 03:55.922
Demi-human is what we would call races
that are similar to humans in some ways...

03:55.923 --> 03:59.761
but aren't actually humans,
like beastmen or fishmen.

04:01.012 --> 04:03.431
In that case,
you could see me as a demi-human.

04:10.354 --> 04:12.314
Lord Dias!

04:12.315 --> 04:15.192
Do you and Alna have any children yet?

04:15.193 --> 04:17.944
Wait, why are you crying?

04:17.945 --> 04:20.490
Calm down, we don't have children yet.

04:21.115 --> 04:23.701
I am planning to have ten children.

04:23.910 --> 04:24.911
Alna!?

04:25.578 --> 04:28.538
Although we don't have children yet...

04:28.539 --> 04:32.168
Dias is raising two orphan children
who look like demi-humans.

04:33.085 --> 04:37.423
A demi-human wife in addition with
demi-human adopted children?

04:46.265 --> 04:48.183
Mother!

04:48.184 --> 04:50.352
I've found a comrade!

04:50.353 --> 04:53.230
That person is Lord Dias!

04:53.231 --> 04:54.190
Dias!

04:54.482 --> 04:57.485
Could it be... you're a demi-human too?

05:00.238 --> 05:01.197
What's wrong?

05:01.825 --> 05:02.743
Are you okay?

05:13.334 --> 05:16.754
What's wrong with his body?

05:19.632 --> 05:21.884
Just tell them.

05:23.261 --> 05:24.220
Yes.

05:25.016 --> 05:26.517
Lord Eldan...

05:26.848 --> 05:31.185
is a half-demi-human, born
between a demi-human and a human.

05:31.435 --> 05:33.938
He can switch between both forms...

05:34.105 --> 05:38.192
but each transformation puts
a huge strain on his body.

05:39.527 --> 05:43.321
The fact that he is a rare half-demi-human...

05:43.322 --> 05:45.241
is Lord Eldan's strength.

05:45.575 --> 05:48.827
But at the same time, he
also has to endure...

05:48.828 --> 05:52.540
the unstable health condition
brought on by his racial status.

05:52.999 --> 05:58.004
Therefore, the devoted care of
the wives is indispensable.

05:58.838 --> 06:01.131
Earlier, because I was so happy...

06:01.132 --> 06:04.634
I got excited and had
mistakenly change form.

06:04.635 --> 06:06.345
I'm sorry.

06:06.554 --> 06:07.930
Don't worry about it.

06:08.264 --> 06:10.850
By the way, I heard there was
a civil war in your land.

06:12.101 --> 06:13.311
That war...

06:13.895 --> 06:16.731
was to protect
the people important to me.

06:17.231 --> 06:22.361
It all started
when Lord Eldan was born.

06:23.237 --> 06:27.365
The former Lord Enkars originally had a wife and children...

06:27.366 --> 06:31.162
but his eldest son looked exactly like him
with an abhorrent personality.

06:31.787 --> 06:35.582
He hated his biological child
who was exactly like him...

06:35.583 --> 06:38.001
so he especially favored
the handsome child...

06:38.002 --> 06:41.005
born to a slave from the
elephant beastman tribe.

06:41.464 --> 06:44.466
He declared that child
to be his son...

06:44.467 --> 06:46.969
and gave him status and power.

06:47.219 --> 06:49.639
That child is Lord Eldan.

06:49.889 --> 06:54.977
Until I was five years old, I thought
I was a normal human.

06:55.770 --> 06:59.523
But after an incident,
I learned my true identity...

07:00.232 --> 07:04.487
and knew that my biological mother
was being treated as a slave.

07:04.779 --> 07:06.071
From then on...

07:06.072 --> 07:10.201
Lord Eldan and his biological mother
secretly kept in touch.

07:10.979 --> 07:15.317
To avoid being discovered by Enkars
who supports enslaving demi-humans...

07:15.623 --> 07:19.794
they quietly carried out activities
to protect the demi-human community.

07:20.836 --> 07:22.921
I wanted to create a world...

07:22.922 --> 07:26.300
where all races could live happily
without discrimination.

07:26.592 --> 07:28.970
That was my desire.

07:31.430 --> 07:34.767
The wives here were
all previously slaves.

07:35.142 --> 07:37.018
After being saved by Lord Eldan...

07:37.019 --> 07:42.566
they sympathized with his ideals
and voluntarily followed to take care of him.

07:44.568 --> 07:50.241
Then what about the rumor that the second son
keeps a bunch of female slaves?

07:50.658 --> 07:54.495
We intentionally spread
those rumors.

07:54.704 --> 07:58.873
But the truth is that Lord Eldan
and his wives...

07:58.874 --> 08:02.253
genuinely love each other.

08:06.924 --> 08:10.761
However, there is a limit to how long
you can keep things hidden.

08:11.303 --> 08:15.348
When he learned of what Lord Eldan
was planning to do, Enkars flew into a rage...

08:15.349 --> 08:17.142
and declared he would kill him,

08:17.143 --> 08:21.564
his mother, and
every single demi-human in the land.

08:22.148 --> 08:25.776
To protect the demi-humans,
Lord Eldan raised the flag of rebellion

08:26.027 --> 08:29.864
After a hard-fought battle,
he defeated Enkars's faction.

08:31.615 --> 08:32.825
<i>I see.</i>

08:33.075 --> 08:37.163
<i>It is what he meant when he said
protecting the people important to him.</i>

08:37.538 --> 08:39.957
I'm sorry for earlier.

08:40.332 --> 08:42.709
I was so happy that I got ahead of myself.

08:42.710 --> 08:47.005
As soon as I heard that the wife and children
of the hero I admire are all demi-humans...

08:47.006 --> 08:49.800
I thought for sure
we would share the same ideals.

08:51.761 --> 08:54.888
There is something I want to confirm.

08:54.889 --> 08:58.726
Is the hero you admire me?

08:58.976 --> 09:01.062
Who else could it be but you?

09:01.562 --> 09:06.567
The story of the national hero Dias
has also reached the Kasdeks territory.

09:07.151 --> 09:09.819
They say you long treasured
your parents' dying wishes...

09:09.820 --> 09:13.031
to help the weak, defeated tens of
thousands of enemy troops...

09:13.032 --> 09:17.994
and used your iron fists
to rehabilitate the arrogant nobles.

09:17.995 --> 09:21.164
I heard those exploits
were even made into a play...

09:21.165 --> 09:24.794
to improve morale and recruit
soldiers in the Royal Capital.

09:27.171 --> 09:31.132
Later, due to interference from the nobles,
the play was canceled.

09:31.133 --> 09:35.554
But the rumors had already spread
far and wide, so everyone knew.

09:36.013 --> 09:37.973
<i>That's the first time I've heard of this...</i>

09:38.390 --> 09:41.894
<i>Most of it is probably just made up.</i>

09:42.436 --> 09:45.146
I don't believe all of it.

09:45.147 --> 09:49.401
But I have also heard
many veterans talk about you.

09:49.652 --> 09:53.114
After meeting you, I'm sure you are
even greater than what's been said.

09:53.781 --> 09:57.076
Of course, he is my husband after all.

09:59.328 --> 10:02.581
Therefore, I would like to officially make a proposal.

10:02.998 --> 10:05.167
Please become our friend.

10:05.668 --> 10:10.131
Let's build a world where demi-humans
and humans can live in harmony.

10:10.548 --> 10:12.633
That is my dream.

10:16.762 --> 10:17.763
Eldan.

10:19.348 --> 10:21.267
I agree with that dream.

10:21.767 --> 10:27.189
In my village, humans and demi-humans
are already living together in peace.

10:27.731 --> 10:32.736
I also hope that sight
will spread even further.

10:34.822 --> 10:36.282
So I too want to propose that.

10:36.615 --> 10:39.201
I hope you will become
our friend.

10:40.911 --> 10:41.996
Yes.

10:43.164 --> 10:46.834
Eldan, your ideals
are truly admirable.

10:47.293 --> 10:50.838
You should be confident
and hold your head even higher.

11:08.105 --> 11:09.022
Yeah.

11:09.023 --> 11:13.360
So we both now understand
the current situation of our respective territories.

11:13.736 --> 11:15.570
Regarding recruiting citizens...

11:15.571 --> 11:18.865
I asked the merchants to help spread
the word the other day...

11:18.866 --> 11:21.076
but I wonder
if there's any better way.

11:21.660 --> 11:24.330
I will announce it in
the Kasdeks territory as well.

11:24.830 --> 11:27.875
But before that, there's
something more important to do.

11:28.834 --> 11:32.712
I think you need to stockpile more food.

11:32.713 --> 11:37.801
If you want to increase the population, you must
produce your own food within the territory.

11:38.677 --> 11:41.387
Winter may seem far away,
but it will arrive soon.

11:41.388 --> 11:45.226
If you don't prepare from now,
you will run into trouble later.

11:45.601 --> 11:46.809
I understand.

11:46.810 --> 11:48.938
Thank you for the helpful advice.

11:49.438 --> 11:52.358
I will try to support you
in whatever capacity I can.

11:55.027 --> 11:57.195
See you later, Eldan.

11:57.196 --> 12:00.616
I look forward to working with you in the future!

12:09.458 --> 12:10.376
I'm back.

12:11.460 --> 12:13.378
You said you would be right back!

12:13.379 --> 12:14.587
We waited forever!

12:14.588 --> 12:16.089
Dias is a liar!

12:16.090 --> 12:18.259
You tricked us!

12:20.135 --> 12:22.012
I'm sorry...

12:25.432 --> 12:27.434
They're finally asleep.

12:27.685 --> 12:30.354
Look how happy they look
when they're sleeping.

12:30.980 --> 12:33.731
And they were just making such a fuss earlier.

12:33.732 --> 12:35.401
They're still just kids after all.

12:36.026 --> 12:40.823
By the way, Dias, is it really okay
that you didn't scold them at all?

12:41.282 --> 12:42.824
They were punching and kicking...

12:42.825 --> 12:46.744
and even said that because Dias lied,
they were going to stay up late tonight.

12:46.745 --> 12:48.706
That was a bit much.

12:49.123 --> 12:51.208
It really wasn't good behavior.

12:51.542 --> 12:55.796
But since I who broke the promise first,
I wanted to apologize to them.

12:56.630 --> 13:01.551
Children who have just gained a family
often act spoiled and throw tantrums...

13:01.552 --> 13:04.013
to test adults,
it's a common thing.

13:04.638 --> 13:06.598
So right now, I want to accept that.

13:07.099 --> 13:12.146
But if this continues,
they'll become spoiled brats.

13:12.479 --> 13:15.774
If they're still like this tomorrow,
I'll give them a strict talking to.

13:18.736 --> 13:23.740
By the way, about the food production
that Eldan suggested...

13:23.741 --> 13:24.783
Yeah.

13:25.159 --> 13:27.745
For now, I'm thinking of trying to start a farm.

13:28.579 --> 13:31.706
I used to farm
before the war broke out...

13:31.707 --> 13:33.207
so I'm quite used to it.

13:33.208 --> 13:36.086
Look here, how are you going to farm here...

13:38.797 --> 13:42.091
There are intruders, quite a few of them too.

13:42.092 --> 13:44.345
Are they Eldan's people?

13:44.762 --> 13:47.348
They're coming from
a different direction.

13:47.639 --> 13:51.602
Besides, anyone wandering around at
this hour is probably up to no good.

13:52.311 --> 13:55.021
So they're bandits?

13:55.022 --> 13:57.023
How annoying.

13:57.024 --> 13:58.942
It's late, let me go take a look.

13:59.360 --> 14:01.570
- You stay here.
- I'm coming too.

14:02.321 --> 14:04.405
Tonight is a new moon.

14:04.406 --> 14:08.368
If we don't have any clues,
we'll never be able to find them.

14:08.369 --> 14:11.538
Then I'll need your magic even more.

14:12.122 --> 14:14.500
We can just leave Klaus to keep watch.

14:16.919 --> 14:18.879
I think someone just called me.

14:22.174 --> 14:25.052
Let me come with you, Dias.

14:28.972 --> 14:31.350
Help me out, Alna.

14:32.017 --> 14:37.022
THE FRONTIER LORD AND THE NEIGHBORING LORD

14:44.029 --> 14:47.324
Do people really live
in this forsaken place?

14:47.658 --> 14:50.159
There's not even a single tree.

14:50.160 --> 14:52.078
The direction is not wrong.

14:52.079 --> 14:55.165
I spent a fortune to hire you guys.

14:55.457 --> 14:58.627
If all you're going to do is complain,
then give me my money back.

14:59.002 --> 15:02.131
Don't worry,
we'll do our job properly.

15:02.673 --> 15:05.801
But why did we have to choose
a moonless night like this?

15:06.552 --> 15:09.263
Don't you know
about the national hero, Dias?

15:10.472 --> 15:13.724
If we face him in broad daylight,
we'll have no chance of winning.

15:13.725 --> 15:16.270
If he discovers this ambush,
we're done for.

15:16.937 --> 15:21.357
Those kinds of rumors
are always exaggerated.

15:21.358 --> 15:22.859
Besides...

15:22.860 --> 15:26.362
with this many of us, it's absurd
to think we can't beat one person.

15:26.363 --> 15:28.364
Don't talk back to me.

15:28.365 --> 15:31.951
And if you are able
to see Eldan, kill him too.

15:31.952 --> 15:34.287
The brat with the barrel belly.

15:34.288 --> 15:36.623
Will there be extra pay?

15:37.708 --> 15:40.001
Eldan is worth 100 silver coins.

15:40.002 --> 15:44.130
And if you manage to kill Dias,
there's an extra bonus of 10 gold coins.

15:44.131 --> 15:45.548
Ooh...

15:45.549 --> 15:47.926
Alright, get fired up, boys!

15:48.260 --> 15:50.595
It's been a long time
since we've had prey this big!

15:50.596 --> 15:52.763
Yeah!

15:52.764 --> 15:55.726
Let's finish them off
and then head back to the city to party!

15:58.312 --> 16:00.606
Boss, Lyle is down!

16:03.150 --> 16:04.484
Throw away the torches!

16:04.485 --> 16:06.570
Archers, shoot towards that red light!

16:10.491 --> 16:13.494
<i>It disappeared. What was that light?</i>

16:13.911 --> 16:14.827
Ouch!

16:14.828 --> 16:18.290
<i>There are only a few attacks,
but the accuracy is incredibly high.</i>

16:18.582 --> 16:21.084
How did they figure out our position?

16:22.211 --> 16:23.711
Keep firing arrows!

16:23.712 --> 16:25.881
As long as we know their position,
we can win!

16:26.131 --> 16:28.050
Shoot to force them out into the open!

16:29.468 --> 16:30.469
Are you okay?

16:31.345 --> 16:32.720
I heard a sound.

16:32.721 --> 16:34.890
Over there, surround them!

16:36.266 --> 16:37.975
You dare play dirty tricks?

16:37.976 --> 16:39.394
I'll kill you!

16:42.231 --> 16:43.106
What?

16:46.860 --> 16:49.111
Besides the archer,
there's another threat!

16:49.112 --> 16:50.280
Regroup!

16:53.825 --> 16:56.453
<i>Did he take down four men
in the blink of an eye?</i>

16:58.664 --> 17:00.206
<i>Now a blue light?</i>

17:00.207 --> 17:02.084
<i>Could it be a demi-human?</i>

17:02.584 --> 17:05.336
Damn it! Where are you, come out here!

17:05.337 --> 17:07.214
You monsters!

17:11.134 --> 17:14.136
<i>Piercing blue eyes, iron armor...</i>

17:14.137 --> 17:16.098
<i>wielding a giant axe in both hands...</i>

17:16.473 --> 17:17.558
<i>He is...</i>

17:18.809 --> 17:20.226
<i>Damn it!</i>

17:20.227 --> 17:24.523
<i>This kind of monster
isn't worth fighting even for 100 gold coins!</i>

17:27.359 --> 17:29.528
Damn it, damn it, damn it!

17:29.945 --> 17:31.529
Useless trash.

17:31.530 --> 17:33.949
I told you, if we were discovered,
we'd be done for!

17:48.213 --> 17:49.714
It hurts...

17:49.715 --> 17:51.341
My old wound is acting up again.

17:53.218 --> 17:56.263
Dias, this is all your fault.

17:56.930 --> 18:00.933
For a noble like me,
it was my natural right.

18:00.934 --> 18:02.561
Yet he...

18:03.020 --> 18:06.023
a commoner who climbed his way up
and gained a little status...

18:06.481 --> 18:09.151
had dared to defy me.

18:09.568 --> 18:12.069
Furthermore, he even...

18:12.070 --> 18:13.238
kicked my...

18:14.323 --> 18:18.827
Until I've claimed my vengeance
for this grudge, I won't give up.

18:19.286 --> 18:21.413
I will definitely kill you!

18:22.205 --> 18:24.498
It's good that there's nothing serious.

18:24.499 --> 18:25.499
I'm sorry.

18:25.500 --> 18:28.712
An arrow grazed my cheek
so I accidentally made a sound.

18:29.630 --> 18:32.424
Since you've heard all of
the story I just told...

18:32.841 --> 18:37.970
you should understand how foolish
this act of banditry is.

18:37.971 --> 18:41.140
We are mercenaries, not bandits.

18:41.141 --> 18:42.308
What did you just say?

18:42.309 --> 18:44.603
No, it's nothing.

18:45.062 --> 18:46.063
Is that so.

18:46.521 --> 18:48.398
As the lord of this land...

18:48.690 --> 18:50.901
I will now pronounce your sentence.

18:52.361 --> 18:53.487
The sentence is...

18:58.033 --> 18:59.784
Isn't that too lenient?

18:59.785 --> 19:01.786
Just a sentence of banishment?

19:01.787 --> 19:05.540
We didn't suffer any losses,
so this is a reasonable way to handle it.

19:06.041 --> 19:10.545
When you were grazed by the arrow,
I really got angry.

19:12.589 --> 19:14.715
But fortunately, no one died.

19:14.716 --> 19:16.885
As long as they've learned their lesson,
it's fine.

19:17.427 --> 19:20.138
If they cause trouble again
in my domain...

19:21.056 --> 19:24.101
I won't be so forgiving next time.

19:25.102 --> 19:26.061
I see.

19:26.561 --> 19:29.939
But it's still a pity
that we let one escape.

19:29.940 --> 19:32.567
With that kind of numbers,
it couldn't be helped.

19:32.943 --> 19:36.405
Whatever, this much loot
is enough.

19:37.823 --> 19:41.118
Can these old, rusty weapons
even be sold for money?

19:41.868 --> 19:44.662
On the steppe, iron is very valuable.

19:44.663 --> 19:47.207
By melting it down, you can
make all sorts of tools.

19:47.582 --> 19:51.545
That's why hunting bandits
is a very fast way to make money.

19:52.337 --> 19:54.840
You also get a reward
from the chief.

19:55.382 --> 19:58.969
My family was never rich in the past.

19:59.678 --> 20:03.348
So I always dreamed of hunting down
an army of bandits like this one day.

20:04.141 --> 20:08.061
But they rarely appear on this steppe.

20:08.603 --> 20:11.731
When I sensed the carriage
bringing you here...

20:11.732 --> 20:15.068
I even secretly rejoiced, thinking
that they have finally arrived.

20:15.819 --> 20:18.571
However, the carriage quickly left.

20:18.572 --> 20:20.073
Leaving only one person behind.

20:20.699 --> 20:22.742
I thought it must be a deserter

20:22.743 --> 20:24.828
who was just lying there waiting to die.

20:25.829 --> 20:29.749
The next morning, while on patrol,
I stopped by to check...

20:29.750 --> 20:33.669
and saw you sleeping soundly,
which left me dumbfounded.

20:33.670 --> 20:37.841
To be sure, I used soul appraisal,
and saw a very strong blue color.

20:38.341 --> 20:39.968
I was truly confused.

20:40.635 --> 20:45.181
I even briefly thought maybe I should
just treat you as a bandit and kill you...

20:45.182 --> 20:47.559
while taking the axe and armor
to be done with it.

20:51.146 --> 20:52.898
But I wonder why.

20:53.982 --> 20:55.400
Why...

20:55.734 --> 20:58.904
did I want to strike up a conversation
with you then?

20:59.571 --> 21:01.782
Even if taking action was too extreme...

21:02.240 --> 21:04.117
I could have completely ignored you.

21:07.120 --> 21:10.290
Honestly, I don't understand it myself.

21:10.665 --> 21:12.834
Before I realized it, I had already done it.

21:14.211 --> 21:17.463
The result is that I have
the life I do now.

21:17.464 --> 21:19.841
So it wasn't
a wrong decision.

21:20.634 --> 21:23.345
But occasionally I still wonder.

21:23.929 --> 21:28.850
Why did I want to
talk to you so much?

21:32.103 --> 21:35.106
Alna, what's wrong?

21:51.373 --> 21:52.374
Alna...

21:55.502 --> 21:56.710
Wait!

21:56.711 --> 21:59.256
Alna! Don't leave me behind.

22:00.335 --> 22:02.587
<i>I chased after her.</i>

22:03.123 --> 22:06.095
<i>Because she was the one who always
illuminated the darkness in my heart...</i>

22:06.096 --> 22:08.723
<i>and keep me moving forward.</i>

22:10.642 --> 22:15.063
<i>Our hands tightly intertwined
along with our dreams</i>

22:15.438 --> 22:19.525
<i>The future we draw together</i>

22:19.526 --> 22:23.530
<i>Is always waiting there</i>

22:31.413 --> 22:36.166
<i>I don't know why
it's still that familiar path</i>

22:36.167 --> 22:40.964
<i>But there are days when my heart
suddenly feels heavy and wants to give up</i>

22:41.214 --> 22:45.718
<i>Tears fall, then a smile blooms</i>

22:45.719 --> 22:50.974
<i>Everyone in life has stepped through
days like that</i>

22:51.460 --> 22:56.172
No matter what form<i>the dawn greets us in</i>

22:56.173 --> 23:00.482
<i>The promise made under the meteor shower</i>

23:00.483 --> 23:03.277
<i>Will never fade</i>

23:03.278 --> 23:07.907
<i>Nor can it be tarnished</i>

23:07.908 --> 23:09.366
<i>Please believe me</i>

23:09.367 --> 23:14.079
<i>Our hands tightly intertwined
along with our dreams</i>

23:14.080 --> 23:18.876
<i>Even if one day we accidentally lose each other</i>

23:18.877 --> 23:23.464
<i>We will definitely meet again under that sky</i>

23:23.465 --> 23:29.304
<i>It is a certainty</i>

23:29.915 --> 23:34.420
<i>So keep smiling</i>
